[sub_resource type="RoseDialogLine" id="RoseDialogLine_rj2ny"]
text = "Well, this history doesn't really have a very long history. The Arumics, who have very good relations with the Eucar, built a fort in the middle of Luna as protection from attacks by monsters infected with the Devil Pest. Eventually, this stronghold developed into the Magic City of the Eucar."
